 1191 f718: a8 f7 68            BREQ vcstat
 1192 f71b: 0d 50               LDTI 'P'
 1193 f71d: a8 f7 4e            BREQ vcprob
 1194 f720: 0d 49               LDTI 'I'
 1195 f722: a8 f7 54            BREQ vcinit
 1196 f725: 0d 43               LDTI 'C'
 1197 f727: a8 f7 5a            BREQ vcclr
 1198 f72a: 0d 4d               LDTI 'M'
