 1239 f795: 04 fa 3a    vcbadl: JSR uartin              ; the rest of the line is dropped (else its characters would run as commands:
 1240 f798: 0d 0a               LDTI 0ah                ; a 0 would stop the machine)
 1241 f79a: a8 f7 a2            BREQ vcbadx
 1242 f79d: 0d 0d               LDTI 0dh
 1243 f79f: aa f7 95            BRNEQ vcbadl
